        <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm mt-2">
          We ensure your commercial hardware adheres to strict safety, fire, and accessibility regulations:
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
          <div class="text-amber-500 font-black text-lg mb-2">NFPA 101</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-[#0f274a] text-sm mb-1.5">Life Safety Egress</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Guarantees immediate single-motion exit during fire emergencies without requiring keys or specialized knowledge.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
          <div class="text-blue-600 font-black text-lg mb-2">ADA Accessible</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-[#0f274a] text-sm mb-1.5">Easy-Grasp Levers</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Replaces round commercial doorknobs with compliant lever handles operable with a single closed fist.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
